ELEGANT 1200mm Walk in Shower Enclosure 900mm Fixed Glass with 300mm Swing Panel Left Right Install Matte Black


Upgrade your bathroom with the ELEGANT Walk in Shower Enclosure.&amp;nbsp;
This versatile enclosure combines a 900mm fixed glass panel with a 300mm swing return panel, creating a spacious 1200mm wetroom solution. The fixed panel features 8mm toughened safety glass for robust stability, while the 6mm swing panel offers smooth, lightweight operation. Both panels are treated with an easy-clean coating that repels water spots and soap scum, keeping your shower crystal-clear with minimal maintenance. The classic matte black aluminium frame complements both modern and industrial-style bathrooms with understated elegance, paired with a stainless steel support rod for lasting durability. The swing return panel opens 90 degrees inwards and outwards via a lift-off hinge, providing flexible access and effortless cleaning. The glass and aluminium are packaged separately to minimise transit damage. Designed for left or right side installation, this enclosure adapts to any bathroom layout. The frameless design creates an open, airy feel, making your shower area look and feel more spacious.

